    <string name="regress_intro_body" formatted="false">Monitors all processes over time and flags:\n  - CPU spikes (&gt;40% sudden jump)\n  - Sustained CPU (&gt;15% for 10+ samples)\n  - Memory leaks (steady RSS growth &gt;20%)\n  - Memory spikes (+50MB sudden jump)\n  - Thread growth (+10 threads)\n\nTap Start to begin recording. Let it run for\na few minutes while reproducing the issue.</string>
